![A small cup of coffee](cover.jpg)

Image: [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_small_cup_of_coffee.JPG)

This was a tiny project to build a list of people who are available
for a "cafecito" — that is, to chat for a while over a good coffee.

Technologies:

- Github Actions
- Javascript
- Markdown

```github
devschile/cafecito | Un bot que lleva la lista de personas buena onda en devschile
```

A script to back up the emoticons of the
[devschile](https://devschile.cl) slack was also made.

```github
devschile/emoticons | Emoticons para Mattermost
```
